# Project Context

At the start of work on this repo, **read `AGENTS.md`** for general context.

`AGENTS.md` contains implementation-oriented guidance for agents: project overview, build/test commands, code style, testing instructions, security considerations, and policies (e.g. updating the OpenAPI spec when endpoints change).

Use it to align with project conventions and avoid contradicting documented policies.
